<content><![CDATA[<grid-plate layout="1-1"><ddd-card slot="col-1" title="In your browser" href="https://browser.hax.cloud" label="Open browser.hax.cloud"><p>Free. browser.hax.cloud runs HAX in the browser and saves to a folder on your computer.</p></ddd-card><ddd-card slot="col-2" title="Static publish" no-arrow=""><p>Free. Publish to GitHub Pages, Netlify, Vercel or Surge and you are done.</p></ddd-card></grid-plate><grid-plate layout="1-1"><ddd-card slot="col-1" title="Self-host" no-arrow=""><p>Free. Run it on PHP or Node. No database. The same site moves between them.</p></ddd-card><ddd-card slot="col-2" title="HAXiam" href="https://hax.psu.edu" label="See hax.psu.edu"><p>For institutions. Many sites from one deploy, as Penn State runs at hax.psu.edu.</p></ddd-card></grid-plate>]]></content>
